## Container (MVP)

| Container / proses | Teknologi | Setup lokal |
|--------------------|-----------|-------------|
| Web app | {{WEB_STACK}} | `{{WEB_APP_PATH}}` — `npm run dev` / `next start` |
| Email worker | {{WORKER_STACK}} | `{{WORKER_SCRIPT}}` (opsional dev) |
| PostgreSQL 15 | DB utama + {{DB_CONSTRAINT_NOTE}} | Docker **host {{PG_HOST_PORT}}** |
| Redis 7 | Queue + rate limit | Docker **{{REDIS_PORT}}** |
| IdP (prod) | OIDC | `AUTH_MODE=oidc` + `OIDC_*` |

